# The built game is dropped in here at packaging time (CI, or build-package.ps1).
# Never committed: it's ~90 MB of build output.
game/

# The update channel is written at packaging time from the building repository
# (CI, or build-package.ps1 -UpdateRepo/-UpdateVersion). Never committed: a
# checked-in one would point every fork's package at whoever committed it.
update.json
